[$in title:["Templates"]]
[$in description:["Template strings, directives, slots, wrappers, control flow and Markdown in Moth."]]
[$in head:[language_theme_head]]

[navbar]
[sidebar]
listed = sync_navigation(sidebar_id)!
[section, $md:
    # Templates

    Templates compose Strings and typed sequences with square brackets.
    A colon introduces the body. Wrappers route child contributions through
    slots, and a condition or loop chooses which output to include.
    Formatters such as `$md` and `$html` build Strings. For keyed bracket
    construction see @../collections (Collections and maps).
]

